    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter this journey and help your pilot to destroy all kinds of opponents that will stand in his way in 6 different worlds. A vertical shooting game with the aim of destroying obstacles and reaching the defined distance to detonate the boss of each level. Travel in this universe of oddities!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341350/extras/33511ab2ba2d5ab07c72382bc9cba6f9.poster.avif?t=1733421781\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341350/extras/33511ab2ba2d5ab07c72382bc9cba6f9.webm?t=1733421781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341350/extras/33511ab2ba2d5ab07c72382bc9cba6f9.mp4?t=1733421781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, shot, shot!!! Destroy the enemies, collect weapons and make high scores to open new pilots!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This package includes a single file with the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341350/extras/5d3530695305859b1d530470da682218.poster.avif?t=1733421781\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341350/extras/5d3530695305859b1d530470da682218.webm?t=1733421781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341350/extras/5d3530695305859b1d530470da682218.mp4?t=1733421781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your keyboard to control you spaceship and shoot all the enemies and bosses to go through 6 stages and win this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By accumulating points you unlock new characters with a total of 8 male and female pilots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEYBOARD INSTRUCTIONS:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341350/extras/5207d28b14a1a8ec005dbeb4b678091b.avif?t=1733421781\" width=614 height=344 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter this journey and help your pilot to destroy all kinds of opponents that will stand in his way in 6 different worlds. A vertical shooting game with the aim of destroying obstacles and reaching the defined distance to detonate the boss of each level. Travel in this universe of oddities!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341350/extras/33511ab2ba2d5ab07c72382bc9cba6f9.poster.avif?t=1733421781\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341350/extras/33511ab2ba2d5ab07c72382bc9cba6f9.webm?t=1733421781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341350/extras/33511ab2ba2d5ab07c72382bc9cba6f9.mp4?t=1733421781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, shot, shot!!! Destroy the enemies, collect weapons and make high scores to open new pilots!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This package includes a single file with the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341350/extras/5d3530695305859b1d530470da682218.poster.avif?t=1733421781\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341350/extras/5d3530695305859b1d530470da682218.webm?t=1733421781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341350/extras/5d3530695305859b1d530470da682218.mp4?t=1733421781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your keyboard to control you spaceship and shoot all the enemies and bosses to go through 6 stages and win this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By accumulating points you unlock new characters with a total of 8 male and female pilots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEYBOARD INSTRUCTIONS:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341350/extras/5207d28b14a1a8ec005dbeb4b678091b.avif?t=1733421781\" width=614 height=344 /></span></p>",
